  "body": "I recently came across this problem, where the manhole was binding to `127.0.0.1` within the container, it wasn't clear to me at first why docker immediately closed all connections then.\r\n\r\nI think a note should be added to `manhole.md`, when using docker, that it has to be set to `0.0.0.0`, or else docker cant forward the port to it.",
